# put and get with containers, corpses and the donation pit. In the temple (3001): Decimus (10), Quintus (25) and
# Smokegod (an immortal). A box (3033: holds 100, nothing over 50), a closed wicker basket (5007), a leather
# backpack (1345: its contents weigh half), a floating disc (23) made into something to put things on, leather
# pants (3062, 50: exactly the box's limit, #57), boots (3063), gloves (3064) and a leather vest (616, 100: too
# heavy for the box), and a strange amulet (307, no drop). Then corpses: a mob's (10), and a player's (11) with an owner (@owner). Then the pit (3010, by
# the altar, 3054): it has no take flag, so what's put in one at a time gets a timer (a random number), but not what
# 'put all' puts in (#58); only immortals can 'get all' from it, and only those of the object's level can get it.
